    "verdict": {
      "html": "<div class=\"verdict\"><div class=\"pct warn\">+0%</div>\n     <div><p class=\"call\">Na média. Serve até aparecer um melhor.</p><p class=\"muted\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">SpATK do seu contra um Magikarp médio no mesmo nível. É o stat que define o dano dele.</p></div></div>\n   <div class=\"trio\"><div><small>Resistência vs médio</small><b>+0%</b></div><div><small>SpATK do máximo possível</small><b>40%</b></div><div><small>HP de combate</small><b>684</b></div></div>"
    },
    "stats": {
      "html": "<div class=\"radar-wrap\"><svg class=\"radar\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Radar dos stats contra o máximo\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"rg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"var(--t1)\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"var(--t2)\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n    <polygon points=\"150,30 245.26279441628824,85 245.26279441628827,194.99999999999997 150,250 54.73720558371177,195.00000000000003 54.737205583711756,84.99999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,57.5 221.4470958122162,98.75 221.4470958122162,181.25 150,222.5 78.55290418778382,181.25000000000003 78.55290418778381,98.74999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,85 197.6313972081441,112.5 197.63139720814414,167.5 150,195 102.36860279185589,167.50000000000003 102.36860279185588,112.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,112.5 173.81569860407205,126.25 173.81569860407205,153.75 150,167.5 126.18430139592795,153.75 126.18430139592795,126.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628824\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628827\" y2=\"194.99999999999997\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.73720558371177\" y2=\"195.00000000000003\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.737205583711756\" y2=\"84.99999999999999\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,97.3 186.3,119.0 197.1,167.2 150.0,184.5 110.2,163.0 103.5,113.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink-2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,97.3 186.3,119.0 197.1,167.2 150.0,184.5 110.2,163.0 103.5,113.2\" fill=\"url(#rg)\" fill-opacity=\".45\" stroke=\"url(#rg)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">HP</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">ATK</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"209.99999999999997\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">DEF</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"k\">SpATK</text><text x=\"35.684646700454124\" y=\"210.00000000000006\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SpDEF</text><text x=\"35.68464670045411\" y=\"77.99999999999999\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SPD</text></svg><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">HP</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"HP: seu 57, médio 57, máximo 147\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:22.61904761904762%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:22.61904761904762%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(58.333333333333336% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">57</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">ATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"ATK: seu 45, médio 45, máximo 118\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:17.857142857142858%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:17.857142857142858%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(46.82539682539682% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">45</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">DEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"DEF: seu 94, médio 94, máximo 190\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:37.301587301587304%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:37.301587301587304%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(75.39682539682539% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">94</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm key\">SpATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpATK: seu 51, médio 51, máximo 126\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:20.238095238095237%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:20.238095238095237%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(50% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">51</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SpDEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpDEF: seu 56, médio 56, máximo 134\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:22.22222222222222%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:22.22222222222222%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(53.17460317460318% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">56</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SPD</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SPD: seu 123, médio 123, máximo 252\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:48.80952380952381%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:48.80952380952381%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(100% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">123</span></div></div></div><p class=\"note\">Contorno tracejado no radar: exemplar médio. O ponto ao lado do nome marca o stat de ataque dele. Resistência é a média de HP, DEF e SpDEF contra o exemplar médio.</p>"
    },
    "imp": {
      "html": "<p style=\"margin:0\">Os golpes de dano dele são especiais: o <b>SpATK</b> (base 15) decide o dano. ATK só pesa na Investida, que é física.</p>\n   <div class=\"mins\">\n    <div><small>Qualidade mínima</small><b>1,3</b><span>sai em ~26% das capturas, cerca de 4</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de SpATK</small><b>20+</b><span>a média é 16,5</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de HP e DEF</small><b>16+</b><span>define quanto aguenta antes da poção</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de SPD</small><b>livre</b><span>só encurta a recarga</span></div>\n   </div>\n   <div><b>Para comparar dois Magikarp</b><ol class=\"prio\"><li>Maior qualidade.</li><li>Empate de qualidade (até 0,05): maior IV de SpATK.</li><li>Depois IV de HP e DEF.</li><li>P2 e P3 desempatam. P4, P5 ou shiny passam na frente de tudo.</li></ol></div>\n   <div class=\"mult\">\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Bate forte</b><small>esses tipos apanham ×2+ dos golpes dele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d9774a\"><i></i>Fogo<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#c4a663\"><i></i>Terra<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#a8975a\"><i></i>Pedra<em>×2</em></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Sofre de</b><small>esses tipos batem ×2,5+ nele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6ba659\"><i></i>Planta<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d6b83a\"><i></i>Elétrico<em>×2,5</em></span></div>\n   </div>"
    },
    "escada": {
      "html": "<div class=\"escada\"><div class=\"degrau eu\" style=\"height:111.85185185185185px;--a:10%\"><span class=\"pin\">você · Nv 100</span>\n      <small>base</small><span class=\"dn\">Magikarp</span><span class=\"bst\">200</span><small>BST · Água</small></div><div class=\"degrau \" style=\"height:200px;--a:28%\"><span class=\"salto\">Nv 100 · +170%</span>\n      <small>evolui no Nv 100</small><span class=\"dn\">Gyarados</span><span class=\"bst\">540</span><small>BST · Água/Voador</small></div></div><div class=\"escada-base\"></div>\n    <p class=\"escada-prog\">Seu Magikarp já tem nível para virar <b>Gyarados</b> (Nv 100): o BST sobe 170%. Fonte: guia da comunidade; confirme a seta \"Precisa de Nv X\" no jogo antes de gastar pedra.</p>"
    },
    "hunt-lede": {
      "text": "60 hunts entre o Nv 60 e o Nv 110 simuladas com o seu exemplar. 0 são seguras (no pior intervalo de 5 s ele leva menos de 50% do HP). No topo ficam as que somam mais abates por hora em hunts de nível mais alto, que pagam mais."
    },
    "hunts": {
      "html": "<p class=\"note\">Nenhuma hunt segura nessa faixa. Suba o nível dele ou teste uma hunt mais baixa abaixo.</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-weight:700\">Evite</p><div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th>Hunt</th><th class=\"r\">Nv</th><th>Tipos</th><th class=\"r\">Bate</th><th class=\"r\">Apanha</th><th class=\"r\">Abates/h</th><th>Pior 5 s</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Exeggutor\" data-l=\"100\"><td>Exeggutor</td><td class=\"r\">100</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6ba659\"><i></i>Planta</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d06688\"><i></i>Psíquico</span></td><td class=\"r\">×0,333</td><td class=\"r\">×2,5</td><td class=\"r\">0</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bad)\"></span><i></i></span> 2.681%</td><td><span class=\"pill bad\">Morre</span></td></tr><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Jolteon\" data-l=\"80\"><td>Jolteon</td><td class=\"r\">80</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d6b83a\"><i></i>Elétrico</span></td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">×2,5</td><td class=\"r\">0</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bad)\"></span><i></i></span> 2.040%</td><td><span class=\"pill bad\">Morre</span></td></tr><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Electabuzz\" data-l=\"100\"><td>Electabuzz</td><td class=\"r\">100</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d6b83a\"><i></i>Elétrico</span></td><td class=\"r\">×1</td><td class=\"r\">×2,5</td><td class=\"r\">0</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bad)\"></span><i></i></span> 1.680%</td><td><span class=\"pill bad\">Morre</span></td></tr><tr class=\"clk\" data-w=\"Venusaur\" data-l=\"80\"><td>Venusaur</td><td class=\"r\">80</td><td><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6ba659\"><i></i>Planta</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a5c9a\"><i></i>Veneno</span></td><td class=\"r\">×0,333</td><td class=\"r\">×2,5</td><td class=\"r\">0</td><td><span class=\"mini\"><span style=\"width:100%;background:var(--bad)\"></span><i></i></span> 1.510%</td><td><span class=\"pill bad\">Morre</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    "bosses": {
      "html": "<div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th>Boss</th><th>Nv</th><th>Bate</th><th>Apanha</th><th>Dano / HP do boss</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Entei</td><td>650</td><td>×2.5</td><td>×0.333</td><td>0,1%</td></tr><tr><td>Moltres</td><td>300</td><td>×2.5</td><td>×1</td><td>0,1%</td></tr><tr><td>Articuno</td><td>300</td><td>×1</td><td>×1</td><td>0%</td></tr><tr><td>Groudon</td><td>3100</td><td>×2.5</td><td>×1</td><td>0%</td></tr><tr><td>Fezandipiti</td><td>179500</td><td>×1</td><td>×1</td><td>0%</td></tr><tr><td>Zamazenta Crowned</td><td>120350</td><td>×1</td><td>×1</td><td>0%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\">Os 6 bosses em que este exemplar entrega mais dano proporcional ao HP estimado, no nível exigido pelo boss. Considera equipe de 5 nesse nível. HP e golpes do boss são estimados pela espécie; confira a equipe completa na aba Equipes.</p>"
    },
    "build": {
      "html": "<div class=\"partner\"><b>Venusaur</b><span>Hunt Nv 80</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6ba659\"><i></i>Planta</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a5c9a\"><i></i>Veneno</span> &nbsp;Aguenta Planta, Elétrico. Bate forte em Água, Planta.</div></div><div class=\"partner\"><b>Brave Tyranitar</b><span>Hunt Nv 150 na Outland</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#a8975a\"><i></i>Pedra</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6f6258\"><i></i>Sombrio</span> &nbsp;Reforço de stats (BST 600).</div></div><div class=\"partner\"><b>Dragonite</b><span>Hunt Nv 100</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6c58c8\"><i></i>Dragão</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a8fd6\"><i></i>Voador</span> &nbsp;Bate forte em Dragão.</div></div><div class=\"partner\"><b>Brave Steelix</b><span>Hunt Nv 150 na Outland</span>\n     <div class=\"why\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9ea3b3\"><i></i>Metálico</span> <span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#c4a663\"><i></i>Terra</span> &nbsp;Reforço de stats (BST 510).</div></div><p class=\"note\">Ele sofre de Planta, Elétrico; 2 desses tipos ficam cobertos. A escolha é por tipo e BST. Simule cada parceiro selecionando ele na busca.</p>"
    },
